<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-songshu" book-id="b-songshu-080" chapter-id="c-songshu-080-yinshuyi-younger-sons" source-id="s-songshu-080-yinshuyi-younger-sons-ws2261200">
  <p id="c-songshu-080-yinshuyi-younger-sons:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">齊敬王<persName id="c-songshu-080-yinshuyi-younger-sons:p001:m0003" ref="hx8_st4_jdd_J">子羽</persName>字<persName id="c-songshu-080-yinshuyi-younger-sons:p001:m0006" ref="hx8_st4_jdd_J">孝英</persName>，孝武帝第十四子也。大明二年生，三年卒，追加封諡。</p>
  <p id="c-songshu-080-yinshuyi-younger-sons:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">晉陵孝王<persName id="c-songshu-080-yinshuyi-younger-sons:p002:m0004" ref="hx8_st4_jdd_K">子雲</persName>字<persName id="c-songshu-080-yinshuyi-younger-sons:p002:m0007" ref="hx8_st4_jdd_K">孝舉</persName>，孝武帝第十九子也。大明六年，年四歲，封晉陵王，食邑二千戶。未拜，其年薨。</p>
  <p id="c-songshu-080-yinshuyi-younger-sons:p003" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">南海哀王<persName id="c-songshu-080-yinshuyi-younger-sons:p003:m0004" ref="hx8_st4_jdd_M">子師</persName>字<persName id="c-songshu-080-yinshuyi-younger-sons:p003:m0007" ref="hx8_st4_jdd_M">孝友</persName>，孝武帝第二十二子也。</p>
  <p id="c-songshu-080-yinshuyi-younger-sons:p004" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">大明七年，年四歲，封南海王，食邑二千戶。未拜，景和元年，為前廢帝所害，時年六歲。太宗即位，追諡。</p>
</text>
